{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is definitely a tough game. You can't do without patience and nerves of steel.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What is it about?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your main character, the &quot;King of Slimes&quot;, is beige and a big fan of mango. For the sake of this delicacy, you will have to overcome difficult obstacles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump over spikes and chasms, dodge cannonballs, avoid hostile slimes, but REACH THE END!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>How about controls?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In words, it's simple. One eye on the slime, the other on the Power Scale. Stop the slider at the right place on the Power Scale with the &quot;Space&quot; key and make a jump. It will determine the strength of EVERY jump.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What else?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- A unique character control system using the power scale;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- A story mode of 4 acts. Will introduce you to the fate of the future &quot;King of Slimes&quot;;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Various obstacles with their own characteristics;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Level assessment on a three-star system depending on your progress;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 10 bright levels;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Beautiful and charming graphics.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3827110?t=1757076785","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827110/8f37d62fe169273f9a8a36294229bdec51d7c93c/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1757076785","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827110/1d1845d95a315c8a57a771658990d1710180b754/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757076785","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827110/1d1845d95a315c8a57a771658990d1710180b754/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757076785","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is definitely a tough game. You can't do without patience and nerves of steel.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What is it about?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your main character, the &quot;King of Slimes&quot;, is beige and a big fan of mango. For the sake of this delicacy, you will have to overcome difficult obstacles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump over spikes and chasms, dodge cannonballs, avoid hostile slimes, but REACH THE END!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>How about controls?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In words, it's simple. One eye on the slime, the other on the Power Scale. Stop the slider at the right place on the Power Scale with the &quot;Space&quot; key and make a jump. It will determine the strength of EVERY jump.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What else?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- A unique character control system using the power scale;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- A story mode of 4 acts. Will introduce you to the fate of the future &quot;King of Slimes&quot;;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Various obstacles with their own characteristics;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Level assessment on a three-star system depending on your progress;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 10 bright levels;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Beautiful and charming graphics.</p>","developers":["Phoenix World"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827110/11b7bacaa0a170c079cfc65758a5e15b648aaa3f/header.jpg?t=1757076785","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><